(text "Power: NMEA 2000 NET-S or a 5-30 V lead on the J4 pads -> fuse -> reverse diode -> TVS -> LMR51606 buck 5 V -> diode-OR into the XIAO 5V pin" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.0 25.0 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0635166e-0e17-5664-9f35-d26630a20c97"))
(text "IMU: LSM6DSO on I2C, address 0x6B by default (JP3), as on the Takuma node" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 60.0 100.0 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "857e78a4-0eb2-5d23-a76f-f216210ff5b6"))
(text "Controller: Seeed XIAO ESP32-C3 / C6 / S3 (pads 1-14 are common to all three)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 240.0 100.0 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c77a1346-0383-5582-b10a-cce33962229e"))
(text "GNSS: 6-pin JST-GH, Pixhawk GPS pinout, UART on D6/D7 + the I2C bus. DNP: fit by hand where wanted" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 318.0 138.0 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "42f4baab-be94-5e39-8b0e-f7f34ed12c20"))
(text "Test pads (rev B): one per layer-crossing net, bottom side, 2.54 mm grid" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 292.0 32.0 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ef6ddb02-f875-5e0d-a9d6-e2a68896fb18"))
(text "CAN: SN65HVD230 on D0 (RX) / D1 (TX), the VESC Express pins. J3 VESC, J4 NMEA 2000. JP6 termination open. JP8/9/10 bridged: cut all three for a build with no CAN" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 240.0 192.0 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7cec8b48-8b24-5051-859d-9c0008580177"))
(text "IO header J6: 10-pin JST-GH, the spare pins on a lead (D0/D1 free once JP8-10 are cut)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 395.0 162.0 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0abf83de-c5bf-51ee-9204-5d9e81185f23"))
(text "BAT: 1S LiPo to the XIAO's own charger (carrier pads under the module)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 232.0 160.0 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c2620c96-ba3f-505b-b73f-a27a12c41e8d"))
(text "Log storage: SD NAND on SPI, under the XIAO" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 140.0 218.0 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "dd3a7e23-c463-5d41-aafc-3defcd1615fd"))
(text "Mechanical: M2 holes at the bow end" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.0 250.0 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "eb97f359-00f6-53df-be5e-535caee82675"))
